{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And the inheritance shall not turn... from one tribe to another tribe.</b> This is a commandment for the hour, before Israel inherited the land. And there were twelve tribes below corresponding to the twelve tribes above, each tribe by itself; and had this tribe sold its inheritance to one of the other tribes, there would have been a mixture of the forces. But in the land of Israel, which is the totality of all the forces, He was not strict."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:38:01.320778708Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}